WEBVTT

00:19.694 --> 00:19.814
Oh.

00:50.845 --> 00:56.026
A thousand miles of winter grey Another dawn,

00:56.086 --> 01:02.568
another day The engines hum, a weary soul A heavy

01:02.628 --> 01:08.089
price, a heavy toll I see your face on frozen

01:08.149 --> 01:13.270
glass A memory that's built to last A single

01:13.290 --> 01:18.972
light that I must find To leave the endless dark

01:19.072 --> 01:19.592
behind

01:22.352 --> 01:29.177
And the lights are bright on this winter's night

01:29.237 --> 01:34.962
Because you're coming home Yes, you're finally

01:35.002 --> 01:41.105
coming home Through the wind and rain Through

01:41.125 --> 01:48.949
the doubt and pain You are not alone No, you're

01:49.029 --> 01:53.291
finally coming home

01:57.092 --> 02:02.673
The towns fly by a blur of light I count the hours

02:02.833 --> 02:08.095
in the night Remembering a whispered vow It

02:08.195 --> 02:13.156
feels so close, it's coming now The fire's lit,

02:13.536 --> 02:19.539
the table's set A promise that I haven't met But

02:19.659 --> 02:23.844
in my heart the feeling grows The warmth that

02:23.904 --> 02:28.710
melts the winter snows

02:28.890 --> 02:35.638
And the lights are bright on this winter's night

02:35.698 --> 02:41.437
Because you're coming home Yes, you're finally

02:41.457 --> 02:47.542
coming home Through the wind and rain Through

02:47.582 --> 02:55.409
the doubt and pain You are not alone No, you're

02:55.549 --> 02:59.252
finally coming home

03:26.438 --> 03:26.559
you

04:15.952 --> 04:22.718
And the lights are bright on this winter's night

04:22.778 --> 04:28.503
Because you're coming home Yes, you're finally

04:28.543 --> 04:34.708
coming home Through the wind and rain Through

04:34.788 --> 04:42.435
the doubt and pain You are not alone Know you're

04:42.595 --> 04:46.036
finally coming

04:49.438 --> 04:51.778
home

04:52.719 --> 05:00.041
Coming home

05:00.361 --> 05:01.201
On this day

05:08.742 --> 05:08.822
you.

